{"id":"7934599233a4e10f","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-predictable.md","title":"Predictable","display":"df-predictable — Predictable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-predictable","aliases":["58-df-predictable","Predictable"],"display":"df-predictable — Predictable","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-predictable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-predictable</span><span>Predictable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predictable — Predictable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal Q\\in V\">\\(H,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal Q\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原接口中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal F_t)\">\\((\\mathcal F_t)\\)</span> 编码为函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_\\bullet\">\\(\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_t=\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t)\">\\(\\mathcal F_t=\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{T\\times\\Omega}\">\\(\\sigma_{T\\times\\Omega}\\)</span> 取指定载集上生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Predictable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Predictable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredictableSigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\mathrm{PredictableSigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PredictableSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t),\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\leq t\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal Q=\\sigma_{T\\times\\Omega}\\left(\n\\{\\{0\\}\\times A:A\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(0)\\}\n\\cup\\{(s,t]\\times A:s,t\\in T\\land s&lt;t\\land A\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PredictableSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t),\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\leq t\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal Q=\\sigma_{T\\times\\Omega}\\left(\n\\{\\{0\\}\\times A:A\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(0)\\}\n\\cup\\{(s,t]\\times A:s,t\\in T\\land s&lt;t\\land A\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Predictable}_S(H,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal Q\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PredictableSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(H;(T\\times\\Omega,\\mathcal Q),(E,\\mathcal E))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Predictable}_S(H,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal Q\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PredictableSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(H;(T\\times\\Omega,\\mathcal Q),(E,\\mathcal E))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原来的时间条带生成方式；函数编码和生成操作的载集现已进入正文。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Protter, Stochastic Integration and Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measurable}$ 取 [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"H,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal F_t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_t=\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{T\\times\\Omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Predictable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredictableSigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PredictableSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t),\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\leq t\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathcal Q=\\sigma_{T\\times\\Omega}\\left(\n\\{\\{0\\}\\times A:A\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(0)\\}\n\\cup\\{(s,t]\\times A:s,t\\in T\\land s<t\\land A\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Predictable}_S(H,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal Q\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PredictableSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(H;(T\\times\\Omega,\\mathcal Q),(E,\\mathcal E))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2247,"backlinks":[{"id":"263379658f1ae518","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Predictable}$ 取 [[../batch11/58-df-predictable.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"e0bca8961c66270c","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Predictable}$ 取 [[../batch11/58-df-predictable.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-976","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-predictable.md|58-df-predictable]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a740bdad87b97ac6","bbbec05fde1d3b01","36d7463d215be751","e03c77e7d23896d9"]}